  "paragraphs": [
   {
    "at": 2.2,
    "lines": [
     [
      0.0,
      2.08,
      "Some places wait for a sunny day."
     ],
     [
      2.76,
      5.82,
      "Yuma, Arizona, wakes up to one almost every morning."
     ],
     [
      6.46,
      8.58,
      "It holds the world record for sunshine."
     ],
     [
      9.18,
      12.76,
      "More than four thousand hours of it, every single year."
     ]
    ]
   },
   {
    "at": 21.0,
    "lines": [
     [
      13.18,
      15.18,
      "The Colorado River made this town."
     ],
     [
      15.74,
      19.96,
      "For centuries, this was the crossing, where travelers found their way west."
     ],
     [
      20.48,
      22.66,
      "And that history is still here to touch."
     ],
     [
      23.3,
      26.1,
      "The Ocean-to-Ocean Bridge, built in 1915."
     ],
     [
      26.82,
      30.5,
      "The Territorial Prison on the hill, where the Old West did its time."
     ],
     [
      31.08,
      33.32,
      "And a Main Street that still feels like one."
     ]
    ]
   },
   {
    "at": 42.8,
    "lines": [
     [
      33.66,
      36.64,
      "Past the edge of town, winter looks a lot like spring."
     ],
     [
      37.3,
      42.84,
      "From November to March, these fields grow about 90 percent of the leafy greens on America's tables."
     ],
     [
      43.44,
      47.04,
      "And in the date groves, Medjool dates ripen slow and sweet."
     ]
    ]
   },
   {
    "at": 57.7,
    "lines": [
     [
      47.56,
      49.34,
      "Then, there's the wild side."
     ],
     [
      50.06,
      52.46,
      "Golden dunes, rolling to the horizon."
     ],
     [
      52.98,
      56.54,
      "The rugged Kofa Mountains, home to desert bighorn sheep."
     ],
     [
      56.54,
      59.44,
      "And a river made for slow afternoons."
     ]
    ]
   },
   {
    "at": 71.3,
    "lines": [
     [
      60.0,
      60.5,
      "Warm days."
     ],
     [
      61.58,
      62.42,
      "Wide open skies."
     ],
     [
      63.26,
      65.44,
      "Sunsets that stop you mid-sentence."
     ],
     [
      66.1,
      67.44,
      "This is Yuma, Arizona."
     ],
     [
      68.12,
      68.86,
      "Come for the sunshine."
     ],
     [
      69.48,
      70.82,
      "Stay for everything else."
     ]
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
